      },
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^3+2x^2+4x+8&=x^2(x+2)+4(x+2)\\\\x^3+2x^2+4x+8&=(x+2)(x^2+4)\\\\2x^3-8x&=2x(x^2-4)\\\\2x^3-8x&=2x(x-2)(x+2)\\\\x^3-4x^2+4x&=x(x^2-4x+4)\\\\x^3-4x^2+4x&=x(x-2)^2\\\\x^4-16&=(x^2-4)(x^2+4)\\\\x^4-16&=(x-2)(x+2)(x^2+4)\\end{align*}$$\nCancel common factors:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^3+2x^2+4x+8}{2x^3-8x}\\times\\frac{x^3-4x^2+4x}{x^4-16}&=\\frac{(x+2)(x^2+4)}{2x(x-2)(x+2)}\\times\\frac{x(x-2)^2}{(x-2)(x+2)(x^2+4)}\\\\\\frac{x^3+2x^2+4x+8}{2x^3-8x}\\times\\frac{x^3-4x^2+4x}{x^4-16}&=\\frac{1}{2(x+2)}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
